/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   spec-i18n — display translations for product-schema content.

   The schemas stay English-canonical (keys, labels, options are the SoT for
   coding and mirroring); THIS dictionary localises what the operator SEES.
   Keyed by:  g:<group title> · f:<field key> · o:<option value>
   plus SPEC_DESC_I18N keyed by the exact English description sentence.
   Technical tokens (SKU, CBM, MOQ, HS, CE, ISO, LED, PLC, V, Hz, kW, bar,
   mm, kg, m³, 20ft/40HQ, needle systems) stay untranslated by design.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

